# Env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local agent config — operator-specific, must not ship with the template.
# Two exceptions: the cloud-session hook and the settings.json that registers
# it, which hold nothing operator- or machine-specific. Personal permissions
# belong in .claude/settings.local.json, which stays ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/

